     1464   function is-gas returns logical
     1465           (input p-gds-code as integer):
     1466   define variable result as logical no-undo.
     1467   define variable c-value as character no-undo.
     1468   define variable c-type as character no-undo.
     1469   do on error undo, return error:
     1470           if (valid-handle(g#attr-lib) <> true) then do:   run gbl/attr-lib.p persistent no-error .   if error-status :error or (valid-handle(g#attr-lib) <> true) then do:     message       "Error starting attr-lib.p" skip       g#attr-lib skip       g#attr-lib :type skip       g#attr-lib :file-name skip       error-status :get-message(1) skip       return-value skip       view-as alert-box error .     stop .   end. end. run gds-attr-value in g#attr-lib
     1471         (input  p-gds-code
     1472         ,input  'fuel-type':U
     1473         ,output c-value
     1474         ,output c-type) no-error.
