     2891                   f-obj-name
     2892                   f-boss-name
     2893                   f-agnt-name
     2894                   f-wrkr-name
     2895                   f-cre-name
     2896                   with frame d-all-r-docs.
     2897           end.
     2898       END.
     2899   ON CHOOSE OF Btn_Copy IN FRAME d-all-r-docs
